  "title": "Tools: added missing options to the help banner of macos-setup-brew.sh",
  "description": "The script `tools/macos-setup-brew.sh` accepts flags which are not shown in the help banner (when running `tools/macos-setup-brew.sh --help`):\n\n`--install-doc-deps` to install the dependencies needed for the rendering of the documentation; and\n\n`--install-test-deps` to install the dependencies needed for automatic testing (although at the moment, the developer is directed to install the test dependencies themselves).\n\nThis MR adds the two options to the banner.",
